abstract: >
  Hosted PCC packs official Silesia 12 to 51,498,645 bytes (DECODE_OK 12/12).
  pulsar 2.5.0 is 55,745,438. gzip-9 is 67,631,990. xz-6 is still ahead (~49.4M).
  Not a #1 claim. AWARE is a retired alias. XZ1 hybrid is retired from product spec.
